<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What metrics should B2B brands track for AI search performance?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Key metrics include brand mention frequency across AI engines, contextual positioning relative to competitors, share of AI voice in your industry, and accuracy of brand attribute descriptions.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Do different industries see varying impacts from AI search on brand visibility?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Yes, technology, professional services, and healthcare sectors often see higher AI search impact due to increased buyer research behavior and complex evaluation criteria in these industries.</p>
</div>
